==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[Taleban]]

===Etymology===
From [[w:Pashto|Pashto]] {{ps-Arab|[[طالبان]]}} ("students" or "seekers"), a Pashto plural of Arabic {{Arab|[[طالب]]}} ("seeker", "student").

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[Sunni]] [[Islamic]] [[student]] [[movement]] in [[Afghanistan]]; organized in 1994 by the [[radical]] [[mullah]] "Mohammad Omar"

